<title>BULGARIA: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICAN ZONE GROUP THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PLOVDIV, Bulgaria 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the first</p>
<p>day matches in Davis Cup Euro/African Zone group three on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Bulgaria beat Malta 3-0</p>
<p>Results (Bulgarian names first):</p>
<p>Ivan Keskinov beat Mark Schembri 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Orlin Stanoychev beat Chris Gatt 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Ivo Bratanov/Ivailo Traikov beat Gordon Asciak/ Mark Schembri</p>
<p>7-6 (10-8) 6-3</p>
<p>Estonia beat Kenya 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Estonian names first):</p>
<p>Andrei Luzgin beat Allan Cooper 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Rene Busch lost to Paul Wekesa 1-6 2-6</p>
<p>Andrei Luzgin/Gert Vilms beat Allan Cooper/Paul Wekesa 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Monaco beat Algeria 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Monaco names first)</p>
<p>Christiophe Bosio beat Mohammed Mahmoudi 6-2 7-6 (6-4)</p>
<p>Sebastien Graeff beat Nourredine Mahmoudi 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Christophe Boggetti/Sebastien Graeff lost to Noudjeim</p>
<p>Hakimi/Nourredine Mahmoudi 6-7 (6-4) 6-7 (8-6)</p>
<p>Moldova beat Cameroon 3-0</p>
<p>Results (Moldovian names first)</p>
<p>Oleg Sinic beat Angelin Mvogo 7-5 3-6 7-5</p>
<p>Juri Gorban beat Yann Auzoux 6-3 6-0</p>
<p>Juri Gorban/Oleg Sinic beat Lionel Kemajou/Joseph Oyebog 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
